    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/d706b2e141b307f202f39fd736d0e757.avif?t=1744998250\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.poster.avif?t=1744998250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.webm?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.mp4?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strikers Club</strong> is your ultimate multiplayer football simulation game where you take control of a player and compete in action-packed matches against others. Master dribbling, passing, and shooting while working with your team to outplay opponents. With gameplay that rewards precision and timing, every move counts, delivering a fast-paced, skill-driven experience that keeps you engaged until the final whistle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free-to-play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strikers Club</strong> is free-to-play and always will be. Cosmetic elements and additional features are available for purchase and obtainable through gameplay and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We always provide a fair online playing field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every player on the field is a real person. Work together to win your association football match using dribbling, shooting, skill moves and other mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no luck or randomness factor involved in <strong>Strikers Club</strong>. The better team will win by having better team-play and individual skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/217d02183b0be3f208c4d25427bf6086.poster.avif?t=1744998250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/217d02183b0be3f208c4d25427bf6086.webm?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/217d02183b0be3f208c4d25427bf6086.mp4?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real football</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strikers Club</strong> implements all of the game rules. Throw-ins, corners, penalties, fouls, and numerous other elements that make the game loyal to the sport.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your position</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's name may be <strong>Strikers Club</strong>, but every position is represented in the game. Choose which one you prefer playing at the start of the match. If you play as a goalie, you have an extra set of mechanics to make the difference. You can even run up to participate in plays up the field!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SEE YOU ON THE FIELD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/3cdc3c696dcd07032e81bacf14196ccf.poster.avif?t=1744998250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/3cdc3c696dcd07032e81bacf14196ccf.webm?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/3cdc3c696dcd07032e81bacf14196ccf.mp4?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.poster.avif?t=1744998250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.webm?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952920/extras/95bd47af80f3892f757ce988070c127f.mp4?t=1744998250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strikers Club</strong> is your ultimate multiplayer football simulation game where you take control of a player and compete in action-packed matches against others. Master dribbling, passing, and shooting while working with your team to outplay opponents. With gameplay that rewards precision and timing, every move counts, delivering a fast-paced, skill-driven experience that keeps you engaged until the final whistle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free-to-play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strikers Club</strong> is free-to-play and always will be. Cosmetic elements and additional features are available for purchase and obtainable through gameplay and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We always provide a fair online playing field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every player on the field is a real person. Work together to win your association football match using dribbling, shooting, skill moves and other mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no luck or randomness factor involved in <strong>Strikers Club</strong>. The better team will win by having better team-play and individual skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\